  "title": "Methanex Corporation Appoints Don Marchand To Its Board Of Directors - Methanex",
  "summary": "VANCOUVER, British Columbia, Nov. 25, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Methanex Corporation (TSX: MX) (Nasdaq: MEOH) is pleased to announce the appointment of Don Marchand to its Board of Directors effective December 1, 2025. With a career spanning nearly four decades in finance and energy infrastructure, Mr. Marchand brings extensive expertise in financial leadership and corporate […]",
